## 3) src/SKHASH/functions/in_sta.py（同上，台站表 .str.strip() 前需先转 str）

```diff
     for merge_col in p_dict['merge_on']:
-        station_df[merge_col]=station_df[merge_col].str.strip()
+        # numeric-looking codes (e.g. location "00") are int-coerced on read; cast before .str
