```

## 4) src/SKHASH/functions/in_sta.py read_reverse_skhash_file（同上，反转表 sta_code 拼接前需先转 str）

```diff
     pol_reverse_df.loc[(pol_reverse_df['start_time'].astype(str)=='0'),'start_time']='1900-01-01'
     pol_reverse_df.loc[(pol_reverse_df['end_time'].astype(str)=='0'),'end_time']='2200-01-01'
+    # numeric-looking codes (e.g. location "20") are int-coerced on read; cast before sta_code join
